      "title": "Yellowstone: most roads and entrances close Nov. 1, 2026, for winter season",
      "summary": "Yellowstone National Park says most of its roads and entrances will close on Nov. 1, 2026, as the park shifts into its winter season. Travelers planning to drive into or through the park should plan to do so before that date, when most vehicle access to the park's road network ends for the season.",
      "verification": "officially_confirmed",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-10-21T15:00:00.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "publisher": "National Park Service",
          "url": "https://www.nps.gov/yell/learn/news/26026.htm",
          "sourceType": "official",
          "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T15:00:00.000Z",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-23T14:01:45.054Z"
        }
      ],
      "terms": null,
      "expiresAt": null,
